    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτρακτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ.</span>
		and in <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			2.271f
		</span></i>, ἡ:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spindle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτρακτον στρέφειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.34
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				162
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				281e
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνου μεστὸν ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					1348
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀνάγκης ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					616c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν Μοιρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					401b15
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(7).447
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>arrow,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. τοξικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					139
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ.</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				290
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tr.</u>
				714
			</span></i>. In this sense specially 
				Lacon.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>upper part of a ship's mast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>spindle-shaped cautery,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Int.</u>
				28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Vid.Ac.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτρεκής,</span> Lat.
				<i>torqueo.</i>)</div>
